			"date": "2023-12-16T21:46:13.048Z",
			"content": "<p>While zachleat.com was a CJS to CJS migration, I’m currently updating 11ty.dev to be Eleventy v3 using ESM.</p><p>That work is in progress here:<br /><a href=\"https://github.com/11ty/11ty-website/pull/1636\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/11ty/11ty-website/p</span><span class=\"invisible\">ull/1636</span></a></p><p>Live demo:<br /><a href=\"https://eleventy-v3--11ty.netlify.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">eleventy-v3--11ty.netlify.app/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
